{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07902","headline":"韩大使东斋会岳上人诸学士 · 孟浩然","name":"韩大使东斋会岳上人诸学士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郡守虚陈榻，林间召楚材。\n山川祈雨毕，云物喜晴开。\n抗礼尊缝掖，临流揖渡杯。\n徒攀朱仲李，谁荐和羹梅。\n翰墨缘情制，高深以意裁。\n沧洲趣不远，何必问蓬莱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}